{"page":99,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:128","surah":4,"ayah":128,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنِ ٱمْرَأَةٌ خَافَتْ مِنۢ بَعْلِهَا نُشُوزًا أَوْ إِعْرَاضًا فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْهِمَآ أَن يُصْلِحَا بَيْنَهُمَا صُلْحًا ۚ وَٱلصُّلْحُ خَيْرٌ ۗ وَأُحْضِرَتِ ٱلْأَنفُسُ ٱلشُّحَّ ۚ وَإِن تُحْسِنُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If a wife fears high-handedness or alienation from her husband, neither of them will be blamed if they come to a peaceful settlement, for peace is best. Although human souls are prone to selfishness, if you do good and are mindful of God, He is well aware of all that you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنِ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-ini","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱمْرَأَةٌ","en_gloss":"a woman","transliteration":"im'ra-atun","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَافَتْ","en_gloss":"fears","transliteration":"khāfat","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْلِهَا","en_gloss":"her husband","transliteration":"baʿlihā","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُشُوزًا","en_gloss":"ill-conduct","transliteration":"nushūzan","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِعْرَاضًۭا","en_gloss":"desertion","transliteration":"iʿ'rāḍan","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (there is) no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمَآ","en_gloss":"on both of them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimā","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُصْلِحَا","en_gloss":"they make terms of peace","transliteration":"yuṣ'liḥā","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","en_gloss":"between themselves ","transliteration":"baynahumā","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":15,"ar":"صُلْحًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"a reconciliation","transliteration":"ṣul'ḥan","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَٱلصُّلْحُ","en_gloss":"and [the] reconciliation","transliteration":"wal-ṣul'ḥu","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":17,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"(is) best","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَأُحْضِرَتِ","en_gloss":"And are swayed","transliteration":"wa-uḥ'ḍirati","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْأَنفُسُ","en_gloss":"the souls","transliteration":"l-anfusu","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلشُّحَّ ۚ","en_gloss":"(by) greed","transliteration":"l-shuḥa","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تُحْسِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"you do good","transliteration":"tuḥ'sinū","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَتَتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fear (Allah)","transliteration":"watattaqū","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":24,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":26,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":28,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":29,"ar":"خَبِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīran","verse_key":"4:128"},{"pos":30,"ar":"١٢٨","en_gloss":"(128)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:128"}]},{"verse_key":"4:129","surah":4,"ayah":129,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَن تَسْتَطِيعُوٓا۟ أَن تَعْدِلُوا۟ بَيْنَ ٱلنِّسَآءِ وَلَوْ حَرَصْتُمْ ۖ فَلَا تَمِيلُوا۟ كُلَّ ٱلْمَيْلِ فَتَذَرُوهَا كَٱلْمُعَلَّقَةِ ۚ وَإِن تُصْلِحُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ غَفُورًا رَّحِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You will never be able to treat your wives with equal fairness, however much you may desire to do so, but do not ignore one wife altogether, leaving her suspended [between marriage and divorce]. If you make amends and remain conscious of God, He is most forgiving and merciful,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَن","en_gloss":"And never","transliteration":"walan","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَسْتَطِيعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"will you be able","transliteration":"tastaṭīʿū","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَعْدِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"deal justly","transliteration":"taʿdilū","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ","en_gloss":"[the] women","transliteration":"l-nisāi","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"even if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَرَصْتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"you desired","transliteration":"ḥaraṣtum","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"but (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَمِيلُوا۟","en_gloss":"incline","transliteration":"tamīlū","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"(with) all","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمَيْلِ","en_gloss":"the inclination","transliteration":"l-mayli","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَتَذَرُوهَا","en_gloss":"and leave her (the other)","transliteration":"fatadharūhā","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَٱلْمُعَلَّقَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"like the suspended one","transliteration":"kal-muʿalaqati","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تُصْلِحُوا۟","en_gloss":"you reconcile","transliteration":"tuṣ'liḥū","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَتَتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fear (Allah)","transliteration":"watattaqū","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":20,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":21,"ar":"غَفُورًۭا","en_gloss":"Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūran","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":22,"ar":"رَّحِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīman","verse_key":"4:129"},{"pos":23,"ar":"١٢٩","en_gloss":"(129)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:129"}]},{"verse_key":"4:130","surah":4,"ayah":130,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن يَتَفَرَّقَا يُغْنِ ٱللَّهُ كُلًّا مِّن سَعَتِهِۦ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ وَٰسِعًا حَكِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but if husband and wife do separate, God will provide for each out of His plenty: He is infinite in plenty, and all wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتَفَرَّقَا","en_gloss":"they separate","transliteration":"yatafarraqā","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُغْنِ","en_gloss":"will be enriched","transliteration":"yugh'ni","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُلًّۭا","en_gloss":"each (of them)","transliteration":"kullan","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَعَتِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"His abundance","transliteration":"saʿatihi","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"and is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٰسِعًا","en_gloss":"All-Encompassing","transliteration":"wāsiʿan","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَكِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīman","verse_key":"4:130"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٣٠","en_gloss":"(130)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:130"}]},{"verse_key":"4:131","surah":4,"ayah":131,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَلَقَدْ وَصَّيْنَا ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ وَإِيَّاكُمْ أَنِ ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ۚ وَإِن تَكْفُرُوا۟ فَإِنَّ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ غَنِيًّا حَمِيدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everything in the heavens and the earth belongs to God. We have commanded those who were given the Scripture before you, and We command you, to be mindful of God. Even if you do ignore Him, everything in the heavens and the earth belongs to Him, and He is self-sufficient, worthy of all praise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And for Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And surely","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَصَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"We have instructed","transliteration":"waṣṣaynā","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِيَّاكُمْ","en_gloss":"and yourselves","transliteration":"wa-iyyākum","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"you fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":20,"ar":"تَكْفُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"you disbelieve ","transliteration":"takfurū","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":21,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"for Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":24,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":27,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":31,"ar":"غَنِيًّا","en_gloss":"Free of need","transliteration":"ghaniyyan","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":32,"ar":"حَمِيدًۭا","en_gloss":"Praiseworthy","transliteration":"ḥamīdan","verse_key":"4:131"},{"pos":33,"ar":"١٣١","en_gloss":"(131)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:131"}]},{"verse_key":"4:132","surah":4,"ayah":132,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَكَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ وَكِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yes, indeed, everything in the heavens 